{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-lane-kpi-normalize","title":"按线路/市场的成本与质量归一","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/cost-lane-kpi-normalize","wordCount":2018,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"按线路-市场的成本与质量归一\">按线路/市场的成本与质量归一</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>前两篇给出了时效与质量的原始指标。第三个维度是成本，而成本是三者中最难做成可比指标的一个——因为**&quot;每票成本&quot;这个数字在不同线路、不同市场之间根本不可比**，而大多数绩效系统的失败正是从把不可比的成本数字放在一起排名开始的。</p>\n<p>不可比来自三个层次。第一层是<strong>计费口径</strong>：跨境物流普遍采用体积重与实际重取大者计费，比例因子按运输方式不同（空运常用 6000、快递常用 5000、海运按立方），同一件包裹在不同承运商处的计费重可能不同。第二层是<strong>费用结构</strong>：基础运费之外还有燃油附加费（通常按指数浮动的百分比）、偏远地区附加费、超规附加费、旺季附加费、以及目的国的清关与派送附加费。第三层是<strong>货币与税制</strong>：报价可能不含税、可能含目的国增值税、可能以不同币种计价。把这三层剥开之后，&quot;每票成本&quot;才能变成可比量——归一化不是把数字变漂亮，而是把结构性差异从衡量对象中剔除，只留下承运商自身定价水平与效率的差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[承运商账单] --&gt; B[基础运费]&#10;  A --&gt; C[燃油附加费]&#10;  A --&gt; D[偏远/超规附加费]&#10;  A --&gt; E[旺季附加费]&#10;  A --&gt; F[清关/派送附加费]&#10;  B --&gt; G[统一计费重&lt;br/&gt;max实重, 体积重]&#10;  C --&gt; G&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[统一币种 + 统一税基]&#10;  H --&gt; I[每公斤公里成本]&#10;  I --&gt; J[与线路基准比对标]\">graph TD\n  A[承运商账单] --&gt; B[基础运费]\n  A --&gt; C[燃油附加费]\n  A --&gt; D[偏远/超规附加费]\n  A --&gt; E[旺季附加费]\n  A --&gt; F[清关/派送附加费]\n  B --&gt; G[统一计费重&lt;br/&gt;max实重, 体积重]\n  C --&gt; G\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[统一币种 + 统一税基]\n  H --&gt; I[每公斤公里成本]\n  I --&gt; J[与线路基准比对标]</pre><h2 id=\"归一化的三步\">归一化的三步</h2><p><strong>第一步，统一计费重。</strong> 体积重的通行算法是 <code>$W_{vol} = \\frac{L \\times W \\times H}{D}$</code>，其中 <code>$L, W, H$</code> 以厘米计，<code>$D$</code> 是体积重除数。同一件包裹在 <code>$D = 5000$</code> 与 <code>$D = 6000$</code> 下的计费重差 20%，如果不统一除数，比较的是承运商的除数选择而不是价格水平。统一的做法是在绩效系统内固定一个除数并据此重算所有承运商的计费重，用重算结果而非账单上的计费重做比较；同时保留一个&quot;实际计费重 / 归一计费重&quot;的比值作为独立字段——这个比值稳定偏离 1 说明该承运商的体积重政策与基准差异大，是一类应当被单独关注的商务信息。</p>\n<p><strong>第二步，拆解附加费。</strong> 附加费的处理有两种策略：并入单价，或单独建模。并入单价看起来简洁，但会掩盖一个重要事实——燃油附加费随油价浮动，把它并入单价会让成本指标的波动被误读为承运商定价行为的变化。正确的做法是分母化：把燃油附加费按当期指数还原为基础运费口径，其余附加费按类型分摊到票上作为独立字段，最终成本指标使用归一后总成本，同时输出燃油成本占比作为独立指标。</p>\n<p><strong>第三步，统一币种与税基。</strong> 跨国比较必须统一到单一币种，且必须明确税基。B2C 场景下常见报价是含税价（DDP，完税后交货），B2B 场景常见不含税（DAP，目的地交货）。两者的差值是目的国增值税，通常在 10%–25% 区间，直接比较会得出&quot;某市场承运商贵一倍&quot;的错误结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归一化视图的实现\">归一化视图的实现</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE VIEW lane_cost_normalized AS&#10;SELECT&#10;  b.carrier_id, b.lane_id, b.shipment_id, b.billed_at, b.incoterm,&#10;  GREATEST(b.actual_weight_kg,&#10;           (b.length_cm * b.width_cm * b.height_cm) / 5000.0)   AS chargeable_kg,&#10;  b.base_freight / fx.rate_to_usd                                AS base_usd,&#10;  b.fuel_surcharge / fx.rate_to_usd                              AS fuel_usd,&#10;  (b.remote_surcharge + b.oversize_surcharge&#10;     + b.peak_surcharge + b.dest_handling) / fx.rate_to_usd      AS other_surcharge_usd,&#10;  CASE WHEN b.incoterm = &#39;DDP&#39; THEN b.duty_vat_usd / fx.rate_to_usd&#10;       ELSE 0 END                                                AS duty_vat_usd&#10;FROM carrier_invoice b&#10;JOIN fx_rate_daily fx&#10;  ON fx.currency = b.currency AND fx.rate_date = b.billed_at::date;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> VIEW</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> lane_cost_normalized</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">carrier_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">lane_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">shipment_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">billed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">incoterm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  GREATEST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">actual_weight_kg</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">           (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length_cm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">width_cm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">height_cm</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chargeable_kg,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">base_freight</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_to_usd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> base_usd,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">fuel_surcharge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_to_usd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                              AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fuel_usd,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">remote_surcharge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">oversize_surcharge</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">     +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">peak_surcharge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dest_handling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_to_usd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> other_surcharge_usd,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">incoterm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'DDP'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">duty_vat_usd</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_to_usd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">       ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_vat_usd</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> carrier_invoice b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fx_rate_daily fx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">currency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> fx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">rate_date</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">billed_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">date</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>视图里保留 <code>incoterm</code> 字段而不直接抹平，是因为下游需要能按税基口径筛选（比较含税承运商时只取 DDP 子集），而不是被一个已经混合的金额困住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本指标的选择-单位成本比总成本有用\">成本指标的选择：单位成本比总成本有用</h2><p>归一化之后，成本指标本身还有一个选择：用总成本还是单位成本？总成本不可用于承运商比较——它主要反映分配了多少货量，而不是价格水平。可行的单位成本有三类，各有适用范围：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>单位成本口径</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每票成本</td>\n<td>归一总成本 / 票数</td>\n<td>同质小件、票型稳定</td>\n<td>票型差异大时失真</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每计费公斤成本</td>\n<td>归一总成本 / 计费重合计</td>\n<td>空运、快递</td>\n<td>忽略距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每公斤公里成本</td>\n<td>归一总成本 / (计费重 × 里程)</td>\n<td>干线、跨线路比较</td>\n<td>需要可靠里程数据</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>跨线路比较应该用<strong>每公斤公里成本</strong>，因为它把距离因素也除了出去。同一承运商在 800 公里与 8000 公里线路上的每公斤成本必然差数倍，这是距离造成的，不是能力差异。只有当比较对象是同一条线路时才可以用每票成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本与质量的对齐-同一分析单元\">成本与质量的对齐：同一分析单元</h2><p>成本指标与质量指标必须落在同一个分析单元上才能联合决策。这个单元是<strong>承运商 × 线路 × 统计窗口</strong>。落在其他粒度上会出问题：按承运商聚合会掩盖线路差异，按票聚合则无法与时效达成率这类比例指标对齐。对齐之后才能构造&quot;性价比&quot;这类复合视角，最常用的两个量是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected &#x27;EOF&#x27;, got &#x27;_&#x27; at position 11: \\text{cost_̲index} = \\frac{…\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\text{cost_index} = \\frac{\\text{归一每公斤公里成本}}{\\text{同线路中位数}}, \\qquad \\text{quality_index} = \\frac{\\text{时效达成率}}{\\text{同线路中位数}}</span></div><p>两个指数都以同线路中位数为基准，因此天然落在同一量纲上，且都以 1.0 为&quot;与该线路典型水平持平&quot;。把它们画在同一张散点图上，就能直观看出哪些承运商处在&quot;低成本高质量&quot;象限、哪些处在&quot;高成本低质量&quot;象限。注意这里是<strong>同线路基准</strong>而非全局基准——跨线路基准会把市场间的结构性差异（基础设施、人工成本、地理形状）误判为承运商差异，这一点在<a href=\"../scorecard-grading/lane-market-benchmark\">线路/市场绩效对标</a>中展开。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用-dea-处理多投入多产出\">用 DEA 处理多投入多产出</h3><p>当一家承运商同时有多个成本投入与多个质量产出时，简单的比值指数不够用。数据包络分析（DEA）从另一条路处理这个问题：它不预设权重，而是为每个决策单元求解一组使其效率最大化的权重。CCR 模型下，对每个承运商 <code>$j$</code> 求解加权产出与加权投入之比的最大值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∗</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>M</mi></msup><mi>y</mi><mo>∗</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mi>j</mi></msup><msub><mi>u</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>∑</mo><mo>∗</mo><msup><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></msup><msubsup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>j</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta*j = \\frac{\\sum*{m=1}^{M} y*m^j u_m}{\\sum*{n=1}^{N} x_n^j v_n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.6353em;vertical-align:-1.0826em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5527em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.1674em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8757em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0973em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9426em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5834em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.1809em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1166em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∗</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8757em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0973em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0826em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>约束是同一组权重下任何其他承运商的比值都不超过 1，且权重非负。求解时把分母固定为 1 化为线性规划，最大化为分子；得分 1 表示位于效率前沿（<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Data_envelopment_analysis\">数据包络分析</a>）。DEA 的价值在于不需要人为定权重，代价是它对异常值敏感、且当承运商数量接近投入产出维度总数时几乎所有单元都会得到 1 分（因为总能找到一组只看自己优势的权重）。实操规则：决策单元数应显著大于投入与产出维度之和，否则结果无意义。CCR 假设规模报酬不变，若希望区分技术效率与规模效率，改用放松该假设的 BCC 模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>跨线路比较&quot;每票成本&quot;是错的，必须先剥开计费重、附加费、币种税基三层差异。</li>\n<li>体积重除数要在绩效系统内统一并重算，同时输出&quot;实际/归一计费重&quot;比值作为商务信号。</li>\n<li>燃油附加费不应并入单价，应按指数还原并单独输出占比，否则成本波动会被误读为定价变化。</li>\n<li>含税与不含税报价不可直接比较，<code>incoterm</code> 必须随成本记录保留。</li>\n<li>跨线路比较用每公斤公里成本，同线路比较才可用每票成本。</li>\n<li>成本与质量指标必须对齐到&quot;承运商 × 线路 × 统计窗口&quot;这一分析单元。</li>\n<li>多投入多产出的效率评估可用 DEA，但决策单元数须显著多于维度总数，否则区分度失效。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按线路/市场的成本与质量归一","id":"按线路-市场的成本与质量归一"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"归一化的三步","id":"归一化的三步"},{"level":3,"text":"归一化视图的实现","id":"归一化视图的实现"},{"level":2,"text":"成本指标的选择：单位成本比总成本有用","id":"成本指标的选择-单位成本比总成本有用"},{"level":2,"text":"成本与质量的对齐：同一分析单元","id":"成本与质量的对齐-同一分析单元"},{"level":3,"text":"用 DEA 处理多投入多产出","id":"用-dea-处理多投入多产出"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"破损丢件与轨迹质量指标","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/carrier-kpi-system/damage-loss-tracking-quality"},"next":{"title":"承运商记分卡模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/carrier-performance-management/scorecard-grading/carrier-scorecard-model"}}